 items",[680,1032,1033],{"class":694},":",[680,1035,1036],{"class":694}," [[",[680,1038,803],{"class":694},[680,1040,1041],{"class":806},"id",[680,1043,803],{"class":694},[680,1045,1046],{"class":694}," =>",[680,1048,1049],{"class":694}," '",[680,1051,1052],{"class":806},"one_off_product_3Qb8Wz1Yt",[680,1054,803],{"class":694},[680,1056,1057],{"class":694},",",[680,1059,1049],{"class":694},[680,1061,1062],{"class":806},"quantity",[680,1064,803],{"class":694},[680,1066,1046],{"class":694},[680,1068,1069],{"class":686}," 1",[680,1071,1072],{"class":694},"]],\n",[680,1074,1076,1079,1081,1084,1086,1088,1091,1093],{"class":682,"line":1075},21,[680,1077,1078],{"class":721},"    redirectUrlSuccess",[680,1080,1033],{"class":694},[680,1082,1083],{"class":785}," route",[680,1085,800],{"class":694},[680,1087,803],{"class":694},[680,1089,1090],{"class":806},"billing.success",[680,1092,803],{"class":694},[680,1094,1095],{"class":694},"),\n",[680,1097,1099,1102,1104,1106,1108,1110,1113,1115],{"class":682,"line":1098},22,[680,1100,1101],{"class":721},"    redirectUrlCanceled",[680,1103,1033],{"class":694},[680,1105,1083],{"class":785},[680,1107,800],{"class":694},[680,1109,803],{"class":694},[680,1111,1112],{"class":806},"billing",[680,1114,803],{"class":694},[680,1116,1095],{"class":694},[680,1118,1120],{"class":682,"line":1119},23,[680,1121,874],{"class":694},[680,1123,1125],{"class":682,"line":1124},24,[680,1126,711],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":710},[680,1128,1130],{"class":682,"line":1129},25,[680,1131,1132],{"class":761},"// Receipts — hosted invoice URLs, no PDF plumbing\n",[680,1134,1136,1139,1141,1143,1145,1148,1151,1153,1156,1158],{"class":682,"line":1135},26,[680,1137,1138],{"class":846},"foreach",[680,1140,894],{"class":694},[680,1142,779],{"class":690},[680,1144,782],{"class":694},[680,1146,1147],{"class":690},"orders ",[680,1149,1150],{"class":694},"as",[680,1152,776],{"class":694},[680,1154,1155],{"class":690},"order",[680,1157,416],{"class":694},[680,1159,907],{"class":694},[680,1161,1163,1166,1168,1170,1172,1175],{"class":682,"line":1162},27,[680,1164,1165],{"class":785},"    echo",[680,1167,776],{"class":694},[680,1169,1155],{"class":690},[680,1171,782],{"class":694},[680,1173,1174],{"class":785},"invoiceUrl",[680,1176,836],{"class":694},[680,1178,1180],{"class":682,"line":1179},28,[680,1181,751],{"class":694},[189,1183,1184,1185,1187,1188,1190],{},"No VAT logic, no tax tables, no invoice templates, no client-side checkout widget to embed —\nthe checkout is a server-side redirect, like Stripe Checkout. See ",[234,1186,72],{"href":72},"\nand ",[234,1189,64],{"href":64}," for the full surface.",[267,1192],{},[270,1194,1196],{"id":1195},"feature-parity-and-whats-still-on-the-roadmap","Feature parity, and what's still on the roadmap",[189,1198,1199],{},"Vatly covers what a SaaS needs to start selling: subscriptions with trials, plan swaps,\ncancellation with grace and resume, one-off purchases, hosted checkout, refunds and chargebacks,\nand — because it's a Merchant of Record — VAT, invoicing and tax compliance handled for you. A\nfew capabilities you may use elsewhere aren't in the box yet. Here's the honest picture, and how\nto bridge it.",[275,1201,1202,1215],{},[278,1203,1204],{},[281,1205,1206,1209,1212],{},[284,1207,1208],{},"Capability",[284,1210,1211],{},"Vatly today",[284,1213,1214],{},"Notes",[301,1216,1217,1228,1240,1254,1263,1277,1293],{},[281,1218,1219,1222,1225],{},[306,1220,1221],{},"Subscriptions, trials, swap, grace, resume",[306,1223,1224],{},"✅",[306,1226,1227],{},"Full lifecycle, Cashier-shaped API",[281,1229,1230,1233,1235],{},[306,1231,1232],{},"One-off / multi-item checkout",[306,1234,1224],{},[306,1236,1237],{},[200,1238,1239],{},"checkout()->create(items: …)",[281,1241,1242,1245,1247],{},[306,1243,1244],{},"VAT, invoicing, tax remittance",[306,1246,1224],{},[306,1248,1249,1250,1253],{},"Handled — it's the point of a MoR. With Cashier (classic Stripe Billing) this is ",[213,1251,1252],{},"your"," job.",[281,1255,1256,1258,1260],{},[306,1257,549],{},[306,1259,1224],{},[306,1261,1262],{},"First-class models + events (more than most provide)",[281,1264,1265,1268,1270],{},[306,1266,1267],{},"Test / live segregation",[306,1269,1224],{},[306,1271,1272,1273,1276],{},"Every record carries ",[200,1274,1275],{},"testmode","; key prefix selects the mode",[281,1278,1279,1283,1286],{},[306,1280,1281],{},[218,1282,516],{},[306,1284,1285],{},"🔜 Roadmap",[306,1287,1288,1289,1292],{},"Until native codes land, model a promo as a dedicated ",[200,1290,1291],{},"subscription_plan_…"," at the discounted price and point that cohort at it. A couple of extra plans in the dashboard — not a blocker for launching offers.",[281,1294,1295,1299,1301],{},[306,1296,1297],{},[218,1298,533],{},[306,1300,1285],{},[306,1302,1303,1304,590,1306,1309],{},"Vatly is built for SaaS, where entitlement follows subscription state — ",[200,1305,206],{},[213,1307,1308],{},"is"," your license check. Per-seat keys for downloadable/offline software (Lemon Squeezy's signature feature) aren't here yet. If you ship license-activated desktop binaries, that's the one workflow to keep elsewhere for now.",[189,1311,1312],{},"The shape of the trade is deliberate: Vatly does the compliance-heavy core that's genuinely\nhard to build — being the seller of record, VAT across the EU, invoicing, disputes — and is\nfilling in the conveniences (coupons next) in the open. For a subscription SaaS selling into\nEurope and the world, there's enough here to launch today.",[267,1314],{},[270,1316,1318],{"id":1317},"why-teams-choose-vatly","Why teams choose Vatly",[189,1320,1321,1322,1325],{},"A Merchant of Record handles VAT, invoicing and tax remittance for you — and that part is now\ntable stakes. Paddle, Lemon Squeezy, Stripe Managed Payments and Vatly all do it; on Stripe it's\na flag on the request. So the real question isn't ",[213,1323,1324],{},"whether"," compliance is handled — it's whose\nentity you sell through:",[1327,1328,1329,1335,1341],"ul",{},[585,1330,1331,1334],{},[218,1332,1333],{},"Europe-first, by design."," EEA-based, EU jurisdiction, customer data kept in Europe. The other\nMoRs sit in the UK (Paddle) or the US (Lemon Squeezy, Stripe Managed Payments) — jurisdiction is\nthe one axis that genuinely separates them, and the reason Vatly exists.",[585,1336,1337,1340],{},[218,1338,1339],{},"No exposure to US policy."," Your seller-of-record relationship and your customers' data stay\nunder EU law — a clean answer when an enterprise buyer, or your own board, asks where they sit.",[585,1342,1343,1346],{},[218,1344,1345],{},"One familiar API."," The Cashier-shaped surface means there's little to learn and little to\nrewrite.",[253,1348,1349],{},[189,1350,1351],{},[218,1352,1353],{},"You Just Ship.",[267,1355],{},[270,1357,1359],{"id":1358},"next-steps","Next steps",[1327,1361,1362,1373,1381],{},[585,1363,1364,1367,1368,1372],{},[218,1365,1366],{},"Starting fresh"," → ",[234,1369,1371],{"href":1370},"README","Getting started"," wires up the trait, config, migrations and\nwebhook in a few minutes.",[585,1374,1375,1367,1378,1380],{},[218,1376,1377],{},"Already running another provider",[234,1379,264],{"href":263},"\nshows how to add Vatly beside your current biller and migrate customers over gradually.",[585,1382,1383,1367,1386,1389,1390,1389,1392,1389,1394,1389,1396,1389,1398],{},[218,1384,1385],{},"Reference",[234,1387,176],{"href":1388},"configuration"," · ",[234,1391,56],{"href":56},[234,1393,64],{"href":64},[234,1395,72],{"href":72},[234,1397,80],{"href":80},[234,1399,38],{"href":38},[189,1401,1402,1403,1406,1407,1406,1410,1413],{},"Compared against, at time of writing:\n",[234,1404,239],{"href":236,"rel":1405},[238]," ·\n",[234,1408,244],{"href":242,"rel":1409},[238],[234,1411,250],{"href":248,"rel":1412},[238],".\nTheir method names and table layouts follow those packages' current releases — verify against\nthe version you have pinned before relying on a specific signature.",[1415,1